1
00:00:00,937 --> 00:00:04,067
(Sheldon:)...who have agreed to speak to you
on the phone right now.

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:07,370
Uh, Dr. Rostenkowski, Dr. Fowler?
Are you there?

3
00:00:07,543 --> 00:00:09,033
(Amy(voice):)We're here.

4
00:00:09,245 --> 00:00:14,945
Thank you for taking time out of your busy
schedule to enlighten these young women.

5
00:00:15,118 --> 00:00:16,748
(Amy:)It's our pleasure.

6
00:00:21,491 --> 00:00:23,891
(Amy:)I'm Dr. Fowler, and I'm a neuroscientist.

7
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:28,190
And I'm Dr. Rostenkowski-Wolowitz,
and I'm a microbiologist.

8
00:00:28,364 --> 00:00:31,694
(Amy:)The world of science needs more women,
but from a young age...

9
00:00:31,868 --> 00:00:35,668
(Amy:)...we girls are encouraged to care
more about the way we look...

10
00:00:35,838 --> 00:00:38,168
(Amy:)...than about the power of our minds.

11
00:00:40,843 --> 00:00:45,333
(Bernadette:)That's true. Every one of you has
the capacity to be anything you want to be.

12
00:00:45,515 --> 00:00:47,885
Unless you wanna be Cinderella.

13
00:00:49,719 --> 00:00:51,649
(Bernadette:)Come at me, see what happens.

14
00:00:55,825 --> 00:01:00,025
(Raj(by text):)This was really fun.

